  accTitle: Replication copies URL records
  accDescr: The URL creator writes to the primary database. The primary sends the same records to a read replica. The URL retriever reads that replica, which can lag.
  C["URL<br/>creator"] -->|"Write URL"| P[("Primary:<br/>URL<br/>records")]
  P -->|"Copy<br/>updates"| R[("Replica:<br/>same<br/>records")]
  U["URL<br/>retriever"] -->|"Read URL;<br/>may be<br/>stale"| R
